 class="flex items-start gap-2"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="mt-[2px] shrink-0 text-positive"><path d="M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span>After the beta, nothing is charged: you subscribe only if you want to</span></li></ul></div><div><form class="space-y-4" action="javascript:throw new Error(&#x27;React form unexpectedly submitted.&#x27;)"><input type="hidden" name="page" value="inscription"/><input type="hidden" name="next" value="/projets/nouveau/detaille?new=1"/><div aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true"></div><div class="space-y-1.5"><label for="lien-email" class="field-label">Your email address</label><input id="lien-email" type="email" inputMode="email" autoComplete="email" autoCapitalize="none" spellCheck="false" required="" class="input" placeholder="you@example.com" aria-describedby="lien-aide" name="email" value=""/><p id="lien-aide" class="pt-0.5 text-[12.5px] leading-snug text-muted">No password: the link we email you confirms your address and signs you in.</p></div><label for="lien-newsletter" class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-start gap-2 py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug text-muted"><input id="lien-newsletter" type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded border-line-strong text-brand-600 accent-brand-600" name="newsletter"/><span>Send me AVYORA news (1 email a month at most)</span></label><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-full py-3 disabled:opacity-60" data-lien-bouton="">Email me my access link</button><p class="text-center text-[12px] leading-snug text-faint">By creating your account, you agree to the <a class="py-3.5 text-brand-600 hover:underline" href="/cgu">Terms of Use (in French)</a> and the <a class="py-3.5 text-brand-600 hover:underline" href="/confidentialite">Privacy Policy (in French)</a>.</p></form><details class="group mt-6 rounded-field border border-line"><summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-ink [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden">I&#x27;d rather choose a password<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-faint transition-transform group-open:rotate-180"><path d="M4 6l4 4 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></summary><div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-4"><form class="space-y-4" action="javascript:throw new Error(&#x27;React form unexpectedly submitted.&#x27;)"><input type="hidden" name="next" value="/projets/nouveau/detaille?new=1"/><div class="space-y-1.5"><label for="nom" class="field-label">First name</label><input id="nom" type="text" autoComplete="given-name" class="input" placeholder="Alex" name="nom"/></div><div class="space-y-1.5"><label for="email" class="field-label">Your email address</label><input id="email" type="email" autoComplete="email" required="" class="input" placeholder="you@example.com" name="email"/></div><div class="space-y-1.5"><label for="password" class="field-label">Password</label><input id="password" type="password" autoComplete="new-password" required="" minLength="12" class="input" aria-describedby="mdp-regles" name="password"/><p id="mdp-regles" class="pt-0.5 text-[12.5px] leading-snug text-muted">At least 12 characters, including at least one letter and one number.</p></div><label for="mdp-newsletter" class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-start gap-2 py-1.5 text-[13px] leading-snug text-muted"><input id="mdp-newsletter" type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 rounded border-line-strong text-brand-600 accent-brand-600" name="newsletter"/><span>Send me AVYORA news (1 email a month at most)</span></label><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-full py-2.5 disabled:opacity-60">Create my account</button><p class="text-center text-[12px] leading-snug text-faint">By creating your account, you agree to the <a class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" href="/cgu">Terms of Use (in French)</a> and the <a class="text-brand-600 hover:underline" href="/confidentialite">Privacy Policy (in French)</a>.</p></form></div></details></div></div><div class="mt-7 border-t border-line pt-5 text-sm text-muted group-has-[[data-lien-envoye]]/auth:hidden">Already have an account? <a class="py-3.5 font-medium text-brand-600 hover:underline" href="/connexion?next=%2Fprojets%2Fnouveau%2Fdetaille%3Fnew%3D1">Sign in</a></div></div></div><div class="relative hidden overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1E1B4B] via-[#241f5e] to-[#191640] p-10 text-white lg:flex lg:flex-col lg:justify-center"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#7C3AED]/25 blur-3xl"></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-16 -left-10 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-[#4F46E5]/20 blur-3xl"></div><div class="relative max-w-sm"><div data-panneau-beta=""><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-[#C4B5FD]"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0"><path d="M8 1l2 4 4 .5-3 3 .8 4.3L8 11l-3.8 1.8L5 8.5 2 5.5 6 5l2-4Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>Free beta</span><h2 class="mt-6 text-[28px] font-semibold leading-[1.15] tracking-tight">Free through December 31, 2026.<br/><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#c4b5fd] to-[#a78bfa] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Become a founding member.</span></h2><ul class="mt-8 space-y-4"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-indigo-100/85"><span class="mt-0.5 grid h-[22px] w-[22px] shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-[7px] bg-white/10 text-[#C4B5FD]"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5 8.5l3 3 6-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"